+## 13. Independent Sol review and final audit
+
+Fresh Sol medium receives: baseline/final diff, all29 PNGs, frozen contract, 29-row comparison matrix with real captures, behavior observations, test outputs, dirty-state checks, exception log and protected-data hashes. It must open the screenshots and inspect the critical routes when tooling permits. It must not rely solely on the implementers’ reports.
+
+Review questions: Does the actual implementation closely match each reference? Are the known raster corrections narrowly applied? Are all real controls still present? Do shared variants preserve Matter? Does research get the correct header without changing map chrome? Do saved edits, context, source target, preview matter and decision state remain correct? Were failed/partial outputs preserved? Are all browser claims supported by actual captures/observations? Were untested controls labelled honestly?
